  "limitations": [
    "Publication plots are embedded ~149-170 ppi raster images, not vector curves.",
    "The spectral ordinate is printed only as 'Sensitivity' with 0.5/1.0 ticks; the linear zero-based reading is an explicit interpretation, not a Harman statement.",
    "The p1 ordinate is a 2850 K tungsten wedge response; no equal-energy correction or source spectrum is supplied, so relative_sensitivity is not equal-energy film sensitivity.",
    "The 380-355 nm and 660-780 nm tails are endpoint-slope extrapolations clamped at 1e-12, not measured.",
    "No still-film RMS, MTF or resolving-power figure is published on the selected HP5 sheet.",
    "No layer decomposition, base spectrum, halation PSF or scanner response is supplied; densitometer=diffuse_visual and antihalation=weak are conservative metadata assumptions, not measurements.",
    "Scope is 135 still film; the p5 curve is representative of roll/sheet according to Harman and is not a format-specific measurement.",
